<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Light Metal - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Light Metal - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	   101.68		vs	   98.49</p>
<p> Operating	    3.61		vs	    4.35</p>
<p> Current	    540    million	  vs	  736    million</p>
<p> Net		  233    million	  vs	  271    million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.81 yen	  vs	    0.95 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    285 million	  vs	 285 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumitomo Light Metal Industries Ltd is an aluminium roller.</p>
</text>
